== S5 recursion/closure: pooled tracker in power class phi = k p^(1-a) W^a q^b ==
 R1(alpha=2) phi(W,q) = sqrt(2cWq): sqrt(2)*sqrt(W)*sqrt(c)*sqrt(q)
 n identical members pooled into one level: phi(nW, q) / (n phi(W,q)) = n**(a - 1) -> n^(a-1): pooling gain grows with n since a<1
